Third-party data and services
-----------------------------

Maritime boundaries
  Flanders Marine Institute (VLIZ). Maritime Boundaries Geodatabase: Maritime
  Boundaries and Exclusive Economic Zones (200NM), version 12.
  https://www.marineregions.org/ — licensed under CC-BY 4.0.
  Polygons in data/geo/zones/ and 200 NM lines in data/geo/boundaries/ are
  redistributed unmodified. Their legal status
  annotations in data/geo/zones.yaml are MDTI configuration, not part of the
  dataset, and do not represent a position of VLIZ.

ADS-B data
  adsb.fi — community ADS-B aggregator, https://adsb.fi/ (default source).
  adsb.fi open data is for personal, non-commercial use only; contact adsb.fi
  for commercial or higher-rate access. No adsb.fi data is redistributed in
  this repository: parser tests use the synthetic fixture
  testdata/adsb/synthetic_readsb_v3.json (fictional aircraft).

  adsb.lol — community ADS-B aggregator, https://adsb.lol/ (fallback source).
  Data made available under the Open Database License (ODbL).
  testdata/adsb/adsblol_*.json remains under ODbL.

AIS data
  AISStream.io — https://aisstream.io/ — subject to the AISStream terms of use.
  Raw AISStream data is not redistributed in this repository.

Anduril Lattice
  Uses the Anduril Lattice SDK for Go (github.com/anduril/lattice-sdk-go) under
  its own license. "Anduril" and "Lattice" are trademarks of Anduril Industries;
  this project is independent and not affiliated with or endorsed by Anduril.

OpenAI
  Tier-2 decisions call the OpenAI API under the user's own account and terms.

